      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 3.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Good morning. I've just opened your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.56,
      "end_seconds": 5.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.67,
      "end_seconds": 12.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.76,
      "end_seconds": 16.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "It's drenching night sweats, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.36,
      "end_seconds": 19.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.88,
      "end_seconds": 24.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I've had it for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.07,
      "end_seconds": 35.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.32,
      "end_seconds": 43.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "I'd say severe. It happens once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.56,
      "end_seconds": 49.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "What about a a lump in your neck, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.85,
      "end_seconds": 53.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Yes, since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.83,
      "end_seconds": 60.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "What about a cough that won't go, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.55,
      "end_seconds": 73.64,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "yes, for about a week. About cough that won't go, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.67,
      "end_seconds": 79.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "any bone pain, fever or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.87,
      "end_seconds": 83.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.98,
      "end_seconds": 88.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.9,
      "end_seconds": 92.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.58,
      "end_seconds": 96.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.16,
      "end_seconds": 101.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "nothing there, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.95,
      "end_seconds": 111.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.95,
      "end_seconds": 115.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.1,
      "end_seconds": 131.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.02,
      "end_seconds": 134.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.25,
      "end_seconds": 144.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.96,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about? I ask because it helps me narrow things down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.03,
      "end_seconds": 147.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "no, nothing at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.22,
      "end_seconds": 151.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Okay, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.18,
      "end_seconds": 153.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "no surgery, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.49,
      "end_seconds": 169.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.61,
      "end_seconds": 184.36,
      "duration_seconds": 12.75,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.83,
      "end_seconds": 194.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.67,
      "end_seconds": 197.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.59,
      "end_seconds": 201.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.05,
      "end_seconds": 210.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.43,
      "end_seconds": 234.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.93,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 66, temp 36.8 degrees, blood pressure 118 over 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.86,
      "end_seconds": 236.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.4,
      "end_seconds": 240.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.47,
      "end_seconds": 246.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.35,
      "end_seconds": 249.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "breathe out slowly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.06,
      "end_seconds": 266.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "There is a a firm, painless lump in the left side of your neck about three centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.92,
      "end_seconds": 292.96,
      "duration_seconds": 22.04,
      "text": "Right, you can relax now. Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with symptoms that need an urgent cancer work-up. Let's get an urgent chest X-ray, for cough and weight loss. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.83,
      "end_seconds": 295.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "okay, I'll do it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.32,
      "end_seconds": 308.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.74,
      "text": "I'll request blood tests, it'll help with weight loss i am referring you on an urgent pathway, which means an appointment within two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.43,
      "end_seconds": 312.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Book a review after the scans."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.91,
      "end_seconds": 318.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "actually, I'll book it on my way out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.59,
      "end_seconds": 325.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
